SUMMARY:The Easiest Catskills Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this point to point hike in the southern Catskills\, featuring
  some new trail near the beginning\, as well as the former Ulster and Dela
 ware Railroad.\nWe had done a hike years ago\, but it has been made into a
 n official trail\, so we'll check it out once. Majority of this will be ve
 ry easy and only gently rolling near the end. Distance is 16 miles.\nThe r
 oute will also feature some weaving trails along some creek\, a tower\, vi
 sitor center\, and a little bit of back road.\nIf needed\, contact me at 9
 08 343 8374
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/315879930/
